# Paths fledge ignores, one glob per line.
# Syntax follows .gitignore conventions.
#
# "#include <path>" splices another ignore file in at that point, resolved
# from this workspace root.
#include .gitignore
.gitignore
.*/
!.github/
!.fledge/
.fledge/*
!.fledge/agents/
.fledge/agents/*
.fledge/agents/fledge/**
!.fledge/agents/user/
.fledge/agents/user/**
!.fledge/agents/user/**/
!.fledge/agents/user/**/*.agent.md

CLAUDE.md
LICENSE
README.md
